{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":46,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["巴比伦的假神"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["彼勒屈膝跪下，",{"text":"尼波弯腰降服。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这些巴比伦的偶像驮在野兽和牲畜背上，成了重负，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使其疲惫不堪。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它们一同屈膝降服，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不但救不了被掳的巴比伦人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"自己也被掳去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：“雅各家啊，以色列家的余民啊，都要听我说。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们一出生，我就照顾你们；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一出母胎，我就呵护你们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使你们年老发白的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我仍然一如既往地扶持你们。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我造了你们，必照顾你们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"呵护你们，拯救你们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"“你们拿谁与我相比，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使之与我同等呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们把谁比作我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使之与我相同呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有些人从囊中倒出金子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又用天平称银子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雇金匠制造神像，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然后向它俯伏叩拜。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们把神像抬起来扛在肩上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"找个地方安置好，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它就在那里呆立不动。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人向它呼求，它不能回应，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不能救人脱离困境。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"“你们这些悖逆的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要将这事铭记在心，仔细思想。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要记住古时发生的事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我是独一无二的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我是上帝，没有谁能与我相比。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我从太初就预言末后的事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从亘古就宣布将来的事。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的旨意必成就，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我想做的必实现。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我从东方召来鸷鸟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从遥远的地方召人来成就我的计划。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我言出必行，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我所谋必成。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们这些冥顽不灵、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"远离公义的人啊，听我说。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要亲自施行公义，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那一天已经不远，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的救恩很快就会来临。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要在锡安赐下救恩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把我的荣美赐给以色列。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/46.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/47.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/45.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}